    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529510/extras/2b7abd49e4a665c1d9aba4f3c15fce56.avif?t=1692352181\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 1. over 40 fish species for your cultivation.<br></li><li> 2. The ranking list shows your wealth ranking.<br></li><li> 3. The unique desktop clultivation with feature of solitary living, which does not require regular care, and you can cultivate on-hook which will not affect other computer operation.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529510/extras/2b7abd49e4a665c1d9aba4f3c15fce56.avif?t=1692352181\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 1. over 40 fish species for your cultivation.<br></li><li> 2. The ranking list shows your wealth ranking.<br></li><li> 3. The unique desktop clultivation with feature of solitary living, which does not require regular care, and you can cultivate on-hook which will not affect other computer operation.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fish culture in reality is expensive and time-consuming! In this game, your desktop is connected to the sea and lake, where you can purchase various types of fish and cultivate on-hook without affecting the computer operation. It's enjoyable to watch the fish swim freely on your computer desktop...",
